Shared kernel build inputs.

socko.factory.img
-----------------
The stock socko filesystem, used as the template for every device.  The
recovery build replaces the selected kernel modules inside it after
rewriting their symbol CRCs and vermagic for the kernel being built.

socko is the pre-vendor_dlkm module location: a flat ext4 filesystem with
the .ko files at its root, one image for the whole UMS512 family.  The
recovery package always flashes it.

src/dhd
-------
Not used by any of the p2*h1*0 profiles.
